  "id": "attentional-focus",
  "term": "attentional focus",
  "definition": "Attentional focus is where a person directs attention while performing a movement or skill. In this context, it commonly refers to focusing either on the effects of the movement in the environment (external focus) or on the body’s own movements (internal focus).",
